abstract: >-
  Reproducible local ideal-MHD single-front tests, three connected Riemann fans,
  an independent Solar Orbiter boundary diagnostic, and SUVI/AIA geometric
  comparisons. The software license applies to code; observational data retain
  their separate source terms and acknowledgements in NOTICE.
